-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5\\\" id=\\\"block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Tuesday 10th November, 6:30 \\u2014 10pm: A\\u2014Z Artist Focus Act I: Icarus - Billy Klotsa</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/billy_klotsa\\\">Billy Klotsa</a> will present her two latest films from the series:<em> Icarus</em> &amp;<em> Icarus Rising</em>, exploring the myth of falling, desire and transcendence.<em> </em>The screening will be accompanied by readings from poet <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/drgolnooshn\\\">Golnoosh Nour</a> and artist <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/ronathey_4\\\">Ron Athey</a> ending on a hypno group session with <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/micheleocelli\\\">Michele Occeli</a> on soundscape.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://a---z.cargo.site/\\\"><u>A\\u2014Z</u></a> Artist Focus at Shoreditch Arts Club</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Since 2012, A\\u2014Z (by Anne Duffau) has operated as a nomadic curatorial platform, moving between sites and communities rather than settling into a fixed institutional home. Our focus events in collaboration with Shoreditch Arts Club continues this itinerant approach, opening a space for close, sustained attention to individual practices within a social and convivial setting.</p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-0f45b7c8900f89f52cf5 .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/e388f110-411c-4f4a-a838-d57e9dd77523_1174/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/st