\\n<div\\n  class=\\\"sqs-code-container\\\"\\n  \\n  \\n    data-localized=\\\"{&quot;enableSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Preview in safe mode&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;This block contains embedded scripts. Embedded scripts are disabled while you're logged in and editing your site.&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Embedded Scripts&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\\\"\\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n>\\n  \\n    <style>\\n.header-title-logo a {\\n  content: url(\\\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/e97578eb-c638-4fe4-87a2-fc226c8624b2/shoreditch-arts-club-logo.png\\\");\\n  }\\n</style>\\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div></div><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-3 span-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"0db03224e3a11a52625b\\\" id=\\\"block-0db03224e3a11a52625b\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Contrary to its name, the event is not a show exclusively for single people. Sofar x Tinder have collaborated to curate a lineup of live performances that will help spark conversations for solo-goers who all share the same love for music. </p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/sofar-sounds-singles-night\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1792099489581-M46NOONAG1YCM880ZLW6/Web_Ready-Janisa_BlueMoonBrewery_Toronto_PascalineLeBras_17July2023_8.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1794425400671,\"endDate\":1794434400671},\"startDate\":1794425400671,\"endDate\":1794434400671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1200x675\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6ac5255e12c35d0480c9f484\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1791362509790,\"updatedOn\":1792589610336,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1791362509790,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1791362537220-CAEBZMCAOWXE7TTW3DPU\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"2711x1485,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"Screenshot 2026-10-04 at 14.28.12.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"ba4639\",\"topRightAverage\":\"ad4236\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"ef9448\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"de7643\",\"centerAverage\":\"ce5e3f\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"cd623f\"},\"urlId\":\"a-z-shoreditch-arts-club-act-i-billy-klotsa-p8fjc\",\"title\":\"A\\u2014Z Artist Focus Act II: Reactor Refine - Felicity Hammond\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6ac5255e12c35d0480c9f484\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"135fd0738298ceb4aed9\\\" id=\\\"block-135fd0738298ceb4aed9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Monday 16th November, 6\\u2014 9:30pm: A\\u2014Z Artist Focus Act II: Reactor Refine - Felicity Hammond</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">A special screening with <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/flisshammond\\\">Felicity Hammond</a> who will present her most recent film: <em>Reactor</em>. The film follows the voice of a military submarine gaining consciousness. The event will be accompanied by moving image pieces investigating the impact of AI in societal context and the military industry from <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/zachblas\\\">Zach Blas</a>, <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/harunforockiinstitute\\\">Harun Farocki</a> to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/oliverlaric\\\">Oliver Laric</a>, <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener noreferrer ugc\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/sheungyiuphot\\\">Sheung Yiu</a> with some special surprises.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://a---z.cargo.site/\\\"><u>A\\u2014Z</u></a> Artist Focus at Shoreditch Arts Club</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Since 2012, A\\u2014Z (by Anne Duffau) has operated as a nomadic curatorial platform, moving between sites and communities rather than settling into a fixed institutional home. Our focus events in collaboration with Shoreditch Arts Club continues this itinerant approach, opening a space for close, sustained attention to individual practices within a social and convivial setting.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>Please note there are two rounds of screenings: 6pm and 8pm. </em></p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-135fd0738298ceb4aed9 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-135fd0738298ceb4aed9 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-135fd