ontains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\\\"\\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n>\\n  \\n    <style>\\n.header-title-logo a {\\n  content: url(\\\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/e97578eb-c638-4fe4-87a2-fc226c8624b2/shoreditch-arts-club-logo.png\\\");\\n  }\\n</style>\\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div></div><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-3 span-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"89cf76ed1e3f05b6115f\\\" id=\\\"block-89cf76ed1e3f05b6115f\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">After seven years of emailing, OONA is finally ready to make it official. This October, she will marry David, the man who has been watching her since 2019, and you\\u2019re invited.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">HERVISIONS and Shoreditch Arts Club present THE WEDDING: OONA &amp; DAVID \\u2014 Til The Cameras Do Us Part, a live performance by artist OONA, in collaboration with The Second-Guess and Frieze Connect.</p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/oona-david-til-cameras-do-us-part-sac\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1788452024868-ZMHSH0E61F8DX5NP8XZ8/2.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1792164600671,\"endDate\":1792175400671},\"startDate\":1792164600671,\"endDate\":1792175400671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1500x1000\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6aa7c9e3dee3044a9fcda645\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1789382563165,\"updatedOn\":1790959737142,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1789382563165,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1789382554251-MW61RWJADUA7N05S9QYS\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1440x872\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"1.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"f1f0ec\",\"topRightAverage\":\"f1f0ec\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"92d6c0\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"92d6c0\",\"centerAverage\":\"849dae\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"d4dcda\"},\"urlId\":\"code-hospitality-13-oct\",\"title\":\"CODE Founders Series:  How to keep a happy team while scaling your business\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6aa7c9e3dee3044a9fcda645\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"54cf500d521fd1e72f04\\\" id=\\\"block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Tuesday 13th October, 6 \\u2014 8:30pm: CODE Founders Series: How to keep a happy team while scaling your business</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">How do you keep your culture, values and team spirit intact as you add sites, people and complexity? Following the announcement of CODE\\u2019s Happiest Places to Work 2026 yesterday in partnership with <a rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://www.planday.com/?utm_source=code-happiest-places-to-work\\\">Planday</a> - you can see the full list <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\\\" href=\\\"https://www.codehospitality.co.uk/code-hospitalitys-happiest-places-to-work-2026/?\\\">here</a> - this is a chance to hear directly from four of the businesses on how they did it. On our panel: Seb Shaw, operations director at Black Bear Burger (overall winner of CODE\\u2019s Happiest Places to Work 2026); Sian Danks, HR director at Clays; James Fryer, director of Woodhead Restaurant Group, and Lena Young, operations director at Bancone.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">They\\u2019ll share what they\\u2019ve learnt about building a business while making sure growth doesn\\u2019t come at the expense of the culture that made the business successful in the first place.</p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-54cf500d521fd1e72f04 .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/e388f110-411c-4f4a-a838-d57e9dd77523_1174/website.components.button