\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div></div><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-3 span-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"73875a1c0dd7f62b1c95\\\" id=\\\"block-73875a1c0dd7f62b1c95\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The&nbsp;CODE&nbsp;Founders Series, powered by Toast, is back. Now in its third year, this popular panel series explores what it takes to make it in&nbsp;hospitality&nbsp;through the eyes of founders and operators.</p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/code-hospitality-\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1788436838187-9DQZOTQV98Y5DNLSNUN3/Founders+Series+first+event.png\",\"contentType\":\"image/png\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1791219600671,\"endDate\":1791228600671},\"startDate\":1791219600671,\"endDate\":1791228600671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1200x675\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6a98511ed68f554af7e149fb\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1788367169652,\"updatedOn\":1789375775646,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1788367169652,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1776156260754-3KO0SZYFPPKJNEA8KDGI\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"6750x4500,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"mjpxsac-web.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"888277\",\"topRightAverage\":\"6c613e\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"c7c1c2\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"c99a7b\",\"centerAverage\":\"bbc3c0\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"78776c\"},\"urlId\":\"mahjong-palace-sac-02-10\",\"title\":\"Mahjong Palace x Shoreditch Arts Club \",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6a98511ed68f554af7e149fb\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"7a73860f78420212d5c5\\\" id=\\\"block-7a73860f78420212d5c5\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Friday 2nd October, 6:30 \\u2014 9:30pm: Mahjong Palace x Shoreditch Arts Club</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">New York's sell-out mahjong club returns to Shoreditch Arts Club for its third instalment!</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">A reimagining of the traditional game in a contemporary setting, led by founder <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.timeout.com/bangkok/art/subhas-kandasamy-mahjong\\\">Subhas Kandasamy</a>.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Staged in galleries, museums and cultural spaces including the National Gallery in London and Siri Sala in Bangkok, <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://mahjongpalace.net/\\\">Mahjong Palace</a> brings together members and guests to enjoy evening cocktails, light bites from BAO and a classic game of the elegant and history-rich Mahjong. </p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Designed to cater to mahjong players of all levels, the social evening is made up of Green/Teaching Tables (beginner) and Red/Open Play Tables (advanced). </p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-7a73860f78420212d5c5 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-7a73860f78420212d5c5 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-7a73860f78420212d5c5 {\\n      m