quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\\\"\\n  \\n  \\n  \\n  \\n>\\n  \\n    <style>\\n.header-title-logo a {\\n  content: url(\\\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/e97578eb-c638-4fe4-87a2-fc226c8624b2/shoreditch-arts-club-logo.png\\\");\\n  }\\n</style>\\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div></div><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-3 span-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"7b2b5453abd71ccb647e\\\" id=\\\"block-7b2b5453abd71ccb647e\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">You are invited into a clandestine literary evening speaking on desire, discomfort, fantasy, memory, power, and the language we use when we finally speak honestly about sex. In the first session, we\\u2019ll speak on the iconic works by French-born erotica writer An\\u00E4is Nin.</p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/secret-sex-book-club-anais-nin\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1787576133830-IP6GWY8BQ725MYU7WVB5/Anais%2Bon%2Bbed+copy.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1789146000671,\"endDate\":1789156800671},\"startDate\":1789146000671,\"endDate\":1789156800671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1500x1198\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6a4f6d21c2c8242f43d4c5af\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1783601507540,\"updatedOn\":1787231209052,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1783601507540,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1783590246898-KX7QO2PG0035YI66BUSR\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1000x1000,1000w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPG\",\"filename\":\"screenshot-2026-05-15-at-17.15.03.jpeg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.4662697201683408,\"y\":0.1795634315127418,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"7a7a7a\",\"topRightAverage\":\"5a5a5a\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"212121\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"202020\",\"centerAverage\":\"515151\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"4a4948\"},\"urlId\":\"hidden-threads-bahareh\",\"title\":\"Hidden Threads by Bahareh Safa\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6a4f6d21c2c8242f43d4c5af\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"768c473945850fd984e2\\\" id=\\\"block-768c473945850fd984e2\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Friday 4th September, 5\\u2014 9pm: Hidden Threads by Bahareh Safa</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Join photographer and visual artist Bahareh Safa for <em>Hidden Threads</em>, a one-day solo exhibition at Shoreditch Arts Club, celebrating her artistic practice through photography, poetry, Persian cultural heritage, and print on silk.</p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The exhibition traces Bahareh's journey from Pairidaeza, her acclaimed photographic project exploring the hidden stories, symbolism, and poetry woven into Persian carpets, to the publication of her <em>Pairidaeza</em> photobook and the transformation of her original artworks into luxurious silk accessories through her brand, Bahar London.</p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The exhibition also premieres selections from her latest photographic project, Nothing Is the Same. Created in response to the recent events in Iran, the series explores identity, resilience and transformation.</p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">At 7:00 pm, Bahareh will be in conversation with curator Zoe Goetzmann, Founder of Artist Workspace Gallery and host of the <em>Art World Women</em> podcast. Together they will discuss Bahareh's creative journey, the symbolism behind her work, the relationship between her artistic practice and Persian carpets, and how storytelling continues through photography, poetry, and silk.</p><p style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Shoreditch Arts Club members have priority and free access. </p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-768c473945850fd984e2 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-768c473945850fd984e2 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-768c473945850fd984e2 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-768c473945850fd984e2 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-768c473945850fd984e2 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-768c473945850fd984e2 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-768c473945850fd984e2 .s