4043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"f197bf9b248a73b671cc\\\" id=\\\"block-f197bf9b248a73b671cc\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Please join us for an exclusive members\\u2019 guided tour at Christie\\u2019s for their current <em>exhibition</em> <em>The Meeting Ground: Scenes from the KNMA Collection</em>, a major institutional exhibition as part of Christie\\u2019s summer exhibition series, bringing South Asian artist histories to wider audiences. </p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.5065662,\"mapLng\":-0.1375612,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Christie&#39;s\",\"addressLine1\":\"8 King Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England, SW1Y 6QT\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/christies-sac-tour-aug-2026\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1784815949611-FDVDL0Z3JJCGC32SXUHQ/WhatsApp+Image+2026-07-23+at+12.21.19.jpeg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1786114800834,\"endDate\":1786118400834},\"startDate\":1786114800834,\"endDate\":1786118400834,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1600x600\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6a59470ac59b73344e8037c5\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1784236228786,\"updatedOn\":1784236633615,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1784236228786,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1784236625516-C9MUYOMBJSNB48WAV8AC\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1428x1030\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"JPG\",\"filename\":\"726220490_17906798961426514_8696230421275212043_n.jpg\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"f5f4f5\",\"topRightAverage\":\"f4f2f3\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"f2f0f1\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"f4f2f3\",\"centerAverage\":\"c9aa9e\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"e6e2de\"},\"urlId\":\"interval-members-mixer-lorette\",\"title\":\"Members Mixer and Tour at Interval \\u2014&nbsp;Lorette \",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6a59470ac59b73344e8037c5\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5\\\" id=\\\"block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Wednesday 5th August, 6 \\u2014 7pm: Members Mixer and Tour at Interval \\u2014 <em>Lorette: Scarlet Topley and Ed Ruscha</em></h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Please join us at the beautiful Interval in Clerkenwell for an intimate members\\u2019 mixer, led by the Club\\u2019s longtime collaborator and Interval co-founder David Gryn.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">See the ongoing exhibition <em>Lorette</em> by Scarlet Topley, the first exhibition of Interval One, an annual programme featuring one graduating artist each year, aiming to showcase their work alongside historical influences, whilst also supporting the beginning stages of their career.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">The exhibition takes its title from a message received from the artist\\u2019s sister whilst on a romantic weekend away in Paris. The tablecloth read Lorette in a scarlet red font with an illustration of a maid sat just above. Lorette refers to a 19th-century Parisian sex worker who was located near the church Notre-Dame-de-Lorette. Scarlet Topley's new works for Lorette emerge from two years of activity in her shed in Camden and at the Ruskin School of Art. The works on display reveal Topley's devotion to Americana and its uncanny solitude.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Scarlet Topley, b.1999 London, is an artist who works across disciplines the way most people try on outfits before a party. She takes notes on television episodes and Reddit threads and she screenshots Reels. The logic of Scarlet\\u2019s artwork is that of re-presentation and arrangement. The objects, paintings, performances and installations she produces speak of the fracturing contemporary experience wherein one moment we might find ourselves crying with a stranger, and the next laughing alone in the dark.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>Reserved exclusively for members of Shoreditch Arts Club and their guests. </em></p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-355da6d89a73b9fc4ca5 .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-defini