pan-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"11290ae058b03c9749a1\\\" id=\\\"block-11290ae058b03c9749a1\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Nick Fraser: Chapter 2 is an immersive one-day exhibition at Shoreditch Arts Club combining original artworks, archival projection, rare film footage and a live musical performance from BoThai. </p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/nick-fraser-chapter-2\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/282cba60-7774-4454-b0de-9db9ef9cfbe6/light-language.jpg\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1785520800671,\"endDate\":1785531600671},\"startDate\":1785520800671,\"endDate\":1785531600671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1491x838\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"6a39430a0ceecb438bdb0923\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1782210035553,\"updatedOn\":1784110123269,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1782210035553,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1782728259194-SQA4ALGKG61S50B22J6T\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"1080x1080\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"WEBP\",\"filename\":\"events_2f549b0b-33b8-4dfa-8728-6a7608c4dfee_592fe2e7-c24f-4b3e-a399-660115b0476a_58fbc932-a97b-4cd4-b633-0096987efb9a.webp\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.4642857142857143,\"y\":0.21586681547619047,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"3b3b3b\",\"topRightAverage\":\"656565\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"0d0d0d\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"575757\",\"centerAverage\":\"e96383\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"7b6c6f\"},\"urlId\":\"casual-readers-bookclub\",\"title\":\"Casual Readers Club\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-6a39430a0ceecb438bdb0923\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"a13bf2ab88baf19eccec\\\" id=\\\"block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Monday 27th July, 6:30 \\u2014 9pm: Casual Readers Club</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Casual Readers Club is a storytelling platform and IRL reading community, nourishing reading as a communal practice and celebrating storytelling in all its forms. For their first session at Shoreditch Arts Club, Casual Readers have selected <em>Suckerfish </em>by Ashani Lewis as their Library Pick of July.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Join us to discuss this painful love letter to childishness, innocence and imagination and to interrogate the questions of what we really owe each other. For this one, we'll be joined by the author, Ashani Lewis, to answer all our burning questions, what a treat! </p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-a13bf2ab88baf19eccec .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/e388f110-411c-4f4a-a838-d57e9dd77523_1174/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/e388f110-411c-4f4a-a838-d57e9dd77523_1174/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.button\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"button\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4174\\\" id=\\\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4174\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">\\n\\n\\n\\n  \\n    \\n    \\n      \\n      \\n\\n\\n\\n<div\\n  class=\\\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--center \\\"\\n  data-animation-role=\\\"button\\\"\\n  data-button-size=\\\"medium\\\"\\n  data-button-type=\\\"primary\\\"\\n  \\n>\\n  <a\\n    href=\\\"https://clyx.com/feed/2f549b0b-33b8-4dfa-8728-6a7608c4dfee?target=event\\\"\\n    class=\\\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\\\"\\n    data-sqsp-button\\n    target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n  >\\n    Tickets Here\\n  </a>\\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n    \\n  \\n    \\n    \\n      \\n    \\n  \\n\\n\\n<style>\\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4174 {\\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n    \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n      \\n      \\n        \\n      \\n    \\n  \\n</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-vars\\\">\\n    #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4174 {\\n      --opacity: 100%;\\n      --translate-x: 0px;\\n      --translate-y: 0px;\\n      --rotation: 0deg;\\n      --scale-x: 100%;\\n      --scale-y: 100%;\\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\\n      --origin-x: 50%;\\n      --origin-y: 50%;\\n      --block-transform: none;\\n\\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\\n    }\\n  </style><style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248\\\" id=\\\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\\\"is-empty\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Shoreditch Arts Club members go free. Please check with the team or your newsletter to redeem your code.<br></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><strong>About the book:</strong><br><em>There are women with higher callings than motherhood. And there are their daughters.</em></p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Kolia is in her twenties, caring for other people's children and looking for a way out of London's dead-end days. She is not looking to be pulled back into the orbit of her passionate, fiery, vulnerable mother, but she may have no choice.</p><p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">In Kolia's childhood, her mother loomed large, both saint and celebrity. Now, she will go to any lengths to repair relations with her estranged daughter.</p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1782818760319_4248 .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\