-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Casual Readers Club is a storytelling platform and IRL reading community, nourishing reading as a communal practice and celebrating storytelling in all its forms.</p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/casual-readers-bookclub\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/1782728259194-SQA4ALGKG61S50B22J6T/events_2f549b0b-33b8-4dfa-8728-6a7608c4dfee_592fe2e7-c24f-4b3e-a399-660115b0476a_58fbc932-a97b-4cd4-b633-0096987efb9a.webp\",\"contentType\":\"image/webp\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1785173400671,\"endDate\":1785180600671},\"startDate\":1785173400671,\"endDate\":1785180600671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"1080x1080\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"69ddee694c843f43778ddbb3\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1776155907535,\"updatedOn\":1783329896365,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1776155907535,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1776156260754-3KO0SZYFPPKJNEA8KDGI\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"6750x4500,2500w\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"mjpxsac-web.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"888277\",\"topRightAverage\":\"6c613e\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"c7c1c2\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"c99a7b\",\"centerAverage\":\"bbc3c0\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"78776c\"},\"urlId\":\"mahjong-palace-sac\",\"title\":\"Mahjong Palace x Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-69ddee694c843f43778ddbb3\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8\\\" id=\\\"block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Friday 24th July, 6:30 \\u2014 9:30pm: Mahjong Palace x Shoreditch Arts Club</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">New York's sell-out mahjong club is landing at Shoreditch Arts Club, a reimagining of the traditional game in a contemporary setting, led by founder <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.timeout.com/bangkok/art/subhas-kandasamy-mahjong\\\">Subhas Kandasamy</a>.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Staged in galleries, museums and cultural spaces including the National Gallery in London and Siri Sala in Bangkok, <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://mahjongpalace.net/\\\">Mahjong Palace</a> brings together members and guests to enjoy evening cocktails, light bites and a classic game of the elegant and history-rich Mahjong. </p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Designed to cater to mahjong players of all levels, the social evening is made up of Green/Teaching Tables (beginner) and Red/Open Play Tables (advanced). </p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Tickets available to public. Members enjoy discounted tickets, please see your newsletter or contact the team to book.</p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-2e626a9fcd7d91b9bbe8 .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</sty