26c8624b2/shoreditch-arts-club-logo.png\\\");\\n  }\\n</style>\\n  \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n</div></div></div><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-3 span-3\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1\\\" data-aspect-ratio=\\\"2.615933412604043\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/bf6c3cf3-1398-4596-a655-57583cbfb9fb_1327/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.spacer\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"b032993ef0b55e4ee7db\\\" id=\\\"block-b032993ef0b55e4ee7db\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\",\"excerpt\":\"<p style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Artist Zethu Maseko brings an evening of music and conversation to Shoreditch Arts Club. A small group of invited artists will be bringing recent works and ongoing projects to share within the space. </p>\",\"location\":{\"mapZoom\":12.0,\"mapLat\":51.52420919999999,\"mapLng\":-0.0764826,\"markerLat\":51.52420919999999,\"markerLng\":-0.0764826,\"addressTitle\":\"Shoreditch Arts Club\",\"addressLine1\":\"6 Redchurch Street\",\"addressLine2\":\"London, England\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"customContent\":null,\"likeCount\":0,\"commentCount\":0,\"publicCommentCount\":0,\"commentState\":2,\"unsaved\":false,\"fullUrl\":\"/events/zethu-maseko-and-friends-july-3\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6386527a7fa42418322e3fbe/eceed3d5-5b9a-4123-87ad-844369804953/IMG_1903.JPG\",\"contentType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"structuredContent\":{\"_type\":\"CalendarEvent\",\"startDate\":1783098000671,\"endDate\":1783108800671},\"startDate\":1783098000671,\"endDate\":1783108800671,\"items\":[],\"pushedServices\":{},\"pendingPushedServices\":{},\"originalSize\":\"3089x2048\",\"recordTypeLabel\":\"event\"},{\"id\":\"69fb3f622090162d53a3c07d\",\"collectionId\":\"6421a0590e521464f0af3302\",\"recordType\":12,\"addedOn\":1778073884110,\"updatedOn\":1782291295672,\"starred\":false,\"passthrough\":false,\"tags\":[],\"categories\":[],\"workflowState\":1,\"publishOn\":1778073884110,\"authorId\":\"654115149373bf6d84a1ccf2\",\"systemDataId\":\"1781258503865-GOGHCBMCK3OFNPK2ZU33\",\"systemDataVariants\":\"2188x1276\",\"systemDataSourceType\":\"PNG\",\"filename\":\"Screens - 1.png\",\"mediaFocalPoint\":{\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5,\"source\":3},\"colorData\":{\"topLeftAverage\":\"ffffff\",\"topRightAverage\":\"fdfdfd\",\"bottomLeftAverage\":\"eeddea\",\"bottomRightAverage\":\"d1897a\",\"centerAverage\":\"f6cfeb\",\"suggestedBgColor\":\"c3b5c0\"},\"urlId\":\"hervisions-chia-amisola\",\"title\":\"In Search Of presented by HERVISIONS\",\"body\":\"<div class=\\\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\\\" data-layout-label=\\\"Post Body\\\" data-type=\\\"item\\\" id=\\\"item-69fb3f622090162d53a3c07d\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\\\"><div class=\\\"row sqs-row\\\"><div class=\\\"col sqs-col-9 span-9\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\\\" data-block-scripts=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/d2a1a69c-95e9-4739-b5f8-14c197d4b62d_1004/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\\\" data-block-type=\\\"1337\\\" data-definition-name=\\\"website.components.html\\\" data-sqsp-block=\\\"text\\\" data-website-component-id=\\\"b8e927617c09deb3069a\\\" id=\\\"block-b8e927617c09deb3069a\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-block-content\\\"><div class=\\\"sqs-text-block-container\\\">\\n  \\n  <div class=\\\"sqs-html-content\\\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Monday 29th June, 7 \\u2014 10pm:<em> In Search Of  </em> presented by HERVISIONS</h3><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>In Search Of</em> considers the rituals through which we turn to technology in search of meaning. Moving between devotion and belief, intimacy and myth-making, the exhibition examines how contemporary technologies have become vessels for longing, reflection, and the construction of personal and collective worlds.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Bringing together works by Chia Amisola, Yichu Li, Zein Majali, Nacoca Ko, and Bea Xu, the programme explores the ways images, virtual spaces, therapeutic practices, and speculative narratives shape how we understand ourselves and others. Across performance, moving image, installation, and conversation, the artists consider how meaning is constructed through acts of attention, imagination, care, and world-building.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Together, the works ask what we return to, what we believe, and what we seek when navigating an increasingly mediated reality.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\">Performance by Chia Amisola.  Screenings and installations by Chia Amisola, Yichu Li, Zein Majali, Nacoca Ko Panel. Q&amp;A with artists and Bea Xu.</p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"></p><p class=\\\"sqsrte-large\\\" style=\\\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\\\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\\\"true\\\"><em>Members of Shoreditch Arts Club get first access to RSVPs. </em><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://hervisions.metalabel.com/insearchof?variantId=1\\\"><em>Public RSVPs now open. </em></a></p></div>\\n\\n\\n  \\n<style id=\\\"container-styles\\\">#block-b8e927617c09deb3069a {\\n    \\n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\\n    \\n      \\n      \\n      \\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n  }\\n\\n  #block-b8e927617c09deb3069a .sqs-html-content {\\n    \\n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\\n}\\n\\n  #block-b8e927617c09deb3069a {\\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\\n  );\\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\n  \\n#block-b8e927617c09deb3069a {\\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\\n    }\\n\\n\\n  \\n  \\n\\n  #block-b8e927617c09deb3069a {\\n    }\\n\\n</style>\\n\\n<style id=\\\"override-container-styles\\\">\\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n            \\n\\n#block-b8e927617c09deb3069a {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  \\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          #block-b8e927617c09deb3069a .sqs-html-content {\\n            \\n            }\\n        }\\n    \\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\\n          \\n          \\n\\n          \\n          \\n          \\n        }</style>\\n<style class=\\\"transform-overrides-vars\\\">\\n  \\n</style>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n</div>\\n</div></div><div class=\\\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-image image-block\\\" data-block-css=\\\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.imageLayout/4b4